OL,3,GNEWSANew bus boost for Sky Blues return
OL,4,Ato top-flight
OL,5,
OL,6,FA new direct bus service linking
OL,7,FCoventry Railway Station and Coventry
OL,8,FBuilding Society Arena, home of the
OL,9,Fcity's football club, is set to be
OL,10,Fintroduced.
OL,12,FThe new service will begin on Saturday
OL,13,F29 August when the Sky Blues play their
OL,14,Ffirst home game back in the Premier
OL,15,FLeague after 25 years away from the
OL,16,Ftop-flight.
OL,18,FWest Midlands Mayor Richard Parker said
OL,19,Fhe struck the deal to ensure football
OL,20,Ffans, concert goers and visitors can
OL,21,Fget to the CBS Arena as well as back to
OL,22,Ftheir train more easily.
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,354,350,200,160,0,100
